{"id":3079,"title":{"romaji":"Urusei Yatsura","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"urusei_yatsura","synopsis":"Urusei Yatsura concerns the tempestuous relationship between two focal characters: Ataru Moroboshi who is possibly the most unfaithful, unlucky and lecherous idiot to have ever been born, and there's Lum, a tigerskin-bikini clad alien package of sex appeal, jealousy and electricity who's fallen for him. The series chronicles the misadventures of these two stubborn teenagers along with a veritable entourage of weird characters. Among these characters is the richest boy on the planet, a superhuman schoolgirl, a fire-breathing baby, a powerful priestess/school nurse, a cute and psychotic alien vixen with a split personality, a gender-bending martial artist, an alien biker chick, an ice queen of Neptune, a deranged monk, a giant ghost cat and hundreds of other lunatic personalities; aliens, humans and inhumans alike interract in endless hysteria in a town named Tomobiki.\n\n\r\n(Source: AniDB)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":1981,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:46","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:14:33","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":1293},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":1293},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":1166},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":377},{"site":"ANN","externalId":90},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":24}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6143,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/FuEWsHu2VuWJ9eplRUpnMLglykS24OLcvaBOSCpH.jpg"},{"id":6144,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/9DCzLPsc282ughcW2IL2xZy0oXPMhlf2zTiqhnUi.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":2,"name":"Studio Deen","slug":"studio_deen"},{"id":44,"name":"Pierrot","slug":"pierrot"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":242,"name":"Urusei Yatsura","slug":"urusei_yatsura"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":464,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":464,"title":{"romaji":"Lum no Love Song","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":513,"version":1,"episodes":"1-77","nsfw":false,"s